@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54385
@anonKey = <owned-QA-publishable-key>
@email = <new-fixture-email>
@password = <fixture-password>
@signupCode = <code-from-Mailpit>
@recoveryCode = <code-from-Mailpit>
@recoveryToken = <access-token-from-recovery-verification>
@newPassword = <different-fixture-password>
@ownerToken = <verified-test-account-token>
@friendToken = <second-verified-test-account-token>
@ownerFriendCode = <code-from-get-my-social-identity>

### Register. GoTrue returns a user and sends a verification code.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/signup
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","data":{"display_name":"QA tài khoản"}}

### Verify email. Read the code from the QA Mailpit inbox.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/verify
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","token":"{{signupCode}}","type":"signup"}

### Sign in. Before verification this request must fail with email_not_confirmed.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Recovery. Known and unknown email both receive an empty 200 response.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/recover
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Verify recovery code. Use the returned access token for the next request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/verify
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","token":"{{recoveryCode}}","type":"recovery"}

### Set the new password. The old password must fail on the login route.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/user
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recoveryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"password":"{{newPassword}}"}

### Revoke the recovery session.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/logout?scope=local
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recoveryToken}}

### Rename the profile using the owner's session; expect the new user_metadata in the ACK.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/user
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"data":{"display_name":"Tên QA đã cập nhật"}}

### A second account with an existing friendship must see the updated name on reload.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/list_friends
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{friendToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### The same code must resolve the new name and report the existing friendship.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/find_partner_by_code
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{friendToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"friend_code":"{{ownerFriendCode}}"}
